cas-ref:VDA-4951
	a fabio:Standard ;
	dc:title
		"Datenfernübertragung von CAD/CAM Daten"@en ,
		"The non-binding VDA Recommendation 4951 describes agreements regarding procedures, formats and contents of files, which standardize the exchange of CAD/CAM data and the associated administrative information and thus make it reliable and secure.  Due to the large number of topics in the field of CAD/CAM data exchange, the recommendation is divided into individual sub-documents, each of which is dedicated to one topic, but some of which also refer to or build on each other.  The numbering of the sub-documents does not indicate any context or a priority, it is simply historical."@de
		;
	.

